1
00:00:10,765 --> 00:00:12,515
(Leonard:)What the hell are you doing?

2
00:00:12,684 --> 00:00:16,564
I'm making petri dishes
to grow throat cultures.

3
00:00:17,147 --> 00:00:18,277
(Leonard:)With lime Jell-O?

4
00:00:18,440 --> 00:00:22,860
(Sheldon:)I need a growth medium, and someone
polished off the apricot yogurt.

5
00:00:24,154 --> 00:00:26,484
(Sheldon:)Here. Swab my throat.

6
00:00:28,491 --> 00:00:30,241
- I don't think so.
- Leonard.

7
00:00:30,410 --> 00:00:34,580
If I'm going to get ahead of this, I need
to find out what's growing in my throat.

8
00:00:36,124 --> 00:00:38,504
(Leonard:)Sheldon, you are not sick.

9
00:00:38,668 --> 00:00:41,958
(Leonard:)This is, but you are not.

10
00:00:42,422 --> 00:00:43,882
(Sheldon:)We have no idea what pathogen...

11
00:00:44,049 --> 00:00:46,639
(Sheldon:)...Typhoid Penny
has introduced into our environment.

12
00:00:46,801 --> 00:00:51,801
(Sheldon:)And having never been to Nebraska, I'm
certain I have no corn-husking antibodies.

13
00:00:54,726 --> 00:00:57,146
(Leonard:)Sheldon, don't you think
you're overreacting?

14
00:00:57,312 --> 00:01:01,062
(Sheldon:)When I'm lying comatose in a hospital
relying on inferior minds to cure me...

